Vendored from the freedesktop.org "sound-theme-freedesktop" project
(https://framagit.org/GNOME/sound-theme-freedesktop), the same two files DMS
ships as its own fallback theme -- kept here only as a last-resort default
when the system doesn't have sound-theme-freedesktop installed (see
src/services/sound.c's resolve_sound_file(), which always prefers
/usr/share/sounds/freedesktop first).

